Package: installatore-apk
Version: 1.0.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Installatore Apk <installatore-apk@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/simonepagliari44-cyber/Installatore-apk
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, adb, desktop-file-utils, xdg-utils
Recommends: aapt | aapt2, policykit-1
Description: Installatore Apk
  Applicazione GTK4 per installare file APK su dispositivi Android tramite ADB.
  .
  Legge i metadati dell’APK, mostra i permessi dichiarati e permette di
  selezionare il dispositivo Android, installare il pacchetto e avviarlo al
  termine. Supporta dispositivi USB e wireless già associati ad ADB.
Description-en: APK installer
  A GTK4 application for installing APK files on Android devices through ADB.
  .
  It reads APK metadata, displays declared permissions, lets you select an
  Android device, installs the package, and optionally launches it afterward.
  It supports USB devices and wireless devices already paired with ADB.
